  "body": "In https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-request, we set request's headers guard to \"request\" if _init_ is empty, even when created from a no-cors request. This allows web developers to modify headers that are not CORS-safelisted.\r\n\r\nThis seems like a spec bug.\r\n\r\nSee also: #560\r\n\r\n@youennf @annevk @jakearchibald \r\n\r\n",
